Package: albedofindr
Title: Calculate Albedo from Landsat 5, 7, and 8 Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sara", "Hesse", , "hesses@mcmaster.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This packages calculates albedo from Landsat 5, 7, and 8 using narrowband-to-broadband conversion, and Liang et al's (2000) linear regression for calculating albedo.
